@title Place macro: the PLC input card says it is symbols only and where to get a card (1920x1080)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# Critical audit C-59: the macro registered no card, so the I/O list stayed empty with no explanation.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "place macro"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
# The Place macro window docks at the right edge: its search field is at x 1205 at 1366 wide and x 1759 at 1920 wide (a click outside the window would take the keyboard away, so each size has its own file).
click 1759 103
wait 4
text plc input card
wait 5
click_text "PLC input card" Label
wait 10
expect "Symbols only"
shot macro-picked
click_text Place Button
wait 20
expect_scene "-A2"
expect "Symbols only"
shot macro-placed
check_layout
